From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan Murray <ryan@aurorasilicon.org>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 11:43:44 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: input: apple,dockchannel-hid: add the actuator
 click strength

While the trackpad actuator is device-controlled, the coprocessor firmware
plays its own click on every press and release. It starts with a weak
placeholder strength for both, and nothing in the firmware raises it, so
the machine has to say what the click should be.

Describe apple,click-strength on the actuator node: the press and the
release strength, each from 1 to 255. Without it the firmware keeps its
own strength.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Ryan Murray <ryan@aurorasilicon.org>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

(cherry picked from commit e40dcef15b708111b3eed0b91c141a56beb1ec9a)
---
 .../bindings/input/apple,dockchannel-hid.yaml  | 18 ++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 18 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/apple,dockchannel-hid.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/apple,dockchannel-hid.yaml
index 924442134b..5d8e015d44 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/apple,dockchannel-hid.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/apple,dockchannel-hid.yaml
@@ -176,6 +176,23 @@ properties:
     additionalProperties: false
     description: The trackpad haptic actuator.
 
+    properties:
+      apple,click-strength:
+        $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/uint32-array
+        description:
+          Strengths at which the actuator firmware plays its own click
+          waveforms while it is device-controlled, first on press and then on
+          release. The coprocessor firmware starts with a weak placeholder
+          strength, so the host writes these over it. When absent, the
+          firmware's strength is kept.
+        items:
+          - description: Strength of the press click.
+            minimum: 1
+            maximum: 255
+          - description: Strength of the release click.
+            minimum: 1
+            maximum: 255
+
   tp_accel:
     type: object
     additionalProperties: false
@@ -240,6 +257,7 @@ examples:
         };
 
         actuator {
+            apple,click-strength = <0xc0 0x6e>;
         };
 
         tp_accel {
